        {
          "source": "1956年《汉字简化方案》, 《汉字简化第一表》 printed p. 1; direct inspection of attached scan sequence page 2, 1920×2801 JPEG; decoded RGB pixel SHA-256 6ebd9717bd2bbda8171affce714d360f49213b1d266d09337e13cef83e8808a6",
          "field": "heading, introductory note, and table entry",
          "text": "The page is headed 《汉字简化第一表》. Its note says the table contains 230 simplified characters arranged by Zhuyin order, and that characters in parentheses are the original traditional characters (括孤里边的字是原来的繁体字). The table visibly lists 边（邊）. This directly identifies 邊 as the traditional counterpart specified for 边 in the 1956 first table.",
          "record_character": "边; 邊",
          "kind": "primary_source_scan_inspection",
          "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1956_Chinese_Character_Simplification_Scheme.djvu",
          "title": "汉字简化方案 — 1956 February booklet, table 1, printed p. 1",
          "accessed_at": "2026-10-03"
        },
        {
          "source": "1956年《汉字简化方案》, State Council resolution leaf, scan sequence page 1 with no printed folio; direct inspection of attached 1920×2801 JPEG; decoded RGB pixel SHA-256 00ef504f807e3f2860d32e59da1dce11be21bfde30ab93ae9d6a4cf25bd188f8",
          "field": "resolution title, adoption date, and implementation paragraphs",
          "text": "The leaf is titled 国务院关于公布汉字简化方案的决议 and states in its subtitle that it was passed at the State Council’s 23rd plenary meeting on 1956-01-28. It says the scheme has three parts: Part I/Table 1 contains 230 simplified characters, already being tried by most newspapers and magazines, and should be used nationwide in printed and handwritten documents from 1956-02-01; apart from reprints of ancient books and other special reasons, the original traditional characters should cease to be used in printed matter. Parts II and III are described separately as 285 simplified characters and 54 simplified components, then released for trial and comment before later revision and formal phased implementation. The exact 边（邊） pair appears on printed p. 1 in Part I, so it falls under the stated first-table scope and date.",
          "record_character": "边; 邊",
          "kind": "primary_source_scan_inspection",
          "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1956_Chinese_Character_Simplification_Scheme.djvu",
          "title": "国务院关于公布汉字简化方案的决议 — 1956 booklet, unnumbered resolution leaf",
          "accessed_at": "2026-10-03"
        }
      ]
